Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:54:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] null patch: 54-judge-block-result-by-what-it-leaves

A sent place or break counted as accepted on any change from the old block, so a block
another actor put in the cell, or the bot's own prediction at a timeout, read as done.
Judged at the ack on the shared world: a break must leave air or a fluid, a place the item's
block kind when the family is known; anything else is refused with OtherBlock. A timeout is
always refused with NoAck. Spec: B6 4.6.
